字面理解就是将要判断的数据不断二分从而找到要的数据

对于有序的数组好用学[[排序初步二分法前提]]

具体实操方案如
#include<stdio.h>
int  search(int key, int a[], int len)
{
	int ret = -1;
	int left = 0;
	int right = len-1;
	while(right>left)
	{
		int mid = (left+right)/2;
		if ( a[mid] == k)
		{
			 ret = mid;
			 break;
		}else if( a[mid]>k)
		{
			right = mid-1;
		}else {
			left = mid+1;
		}
	}
	return ret;
}
